  "summary": "On 3 September 1783 David Hartley for Britain and John Adams, Benjamin Franklin and John Jay for the United States signed the Treaty of Paris. Britain recognised the thirteen states as free, sovereign and independent and the treaty fixed their boundaries. It formally ended the American Revolutionary War.",
